  "assertions": [
    "A protected zero-Max-Age observation writes its complete initial report, then starts renewal with the original token and a new Message ID",
    "The peer returns an empty acknowledgment so the renewal remains in flight when the explicit cancel command is admitted",
    "If libcoap cannot submit its tracked cancellation, the exchange constructs a public-API GET Observe=1 fallback for the original route, token and Accept value",
    "The peer receives exactly one cancellation with a Message ID distinct from the renewal request",
    "Without an application-usable cancellation confirmation, the exact command deadline returns timeout and closes the worker cleanly",
    "The canceled server observer cannot schedule another report and no report or terminal observation envelope follows the command timeout",
    "macOS and Linux sanitizer lanes execute the same production worker and protected renewal/cancel trace"
  ],
